[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="CasChapterSceneVisual" load_steps=22 format=3]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/chapter_scene_resource.gd" id="1_scene"]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/chapter_line_resource.gd" id="2_line"]

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_0"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="夜里，食堂还剩一锅汤。负责熄灯的人已经来问过两次，最后把钥匙留在门口，说你们自己收拾好，别把整条走廊都点亮。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_1"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="lamson"

speaker_name=""

text="谁把勺子和螺丝摆一起了？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_2"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="这回真不是我。我今天只有一只干净口袋。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_3"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你们把桌面一点点腾出来。弗莱彻端着锅找不到地方放，帕金斯索性把海图卷到隔壁。没有谁宣布今晚不谈工作，它只是短暂地被一只热锅挤走了。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_4"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="今天是不是给你们增加了很多事？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_5"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="lamson"

speaker_name=""

text="有。工具袋多装了一副手套，医务室多开了两次门，德雷顿的毯子还没干。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_6"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="你就不能说得稍微温柔一点？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_7"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="lamson"

speaker_name=""

text="他说很多，我在帮他数。真数完就知道没想的那么多。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_8"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你愣了一会儿，低头喝汤。汤里有一片没切碎的菜根，已经煮软了。你把它从碗底拨出来，发现自己不再急着为每一口找到明天的偿还方式。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_9"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="fletcher"

speaker_name=""

text="我们也会给你添麻烦。以后你替我查航路，可能要一遍遍问；德雷顿临出发找不到手套，你可能得陪她翻；拉姆森——"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_10"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="lamson"

speaker_name=""

text="我的东西能找到，不用替我举例。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_11"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="perkins"

speaker_name=""

text="她需要你劝她别连着修到天亮。这条我可以作证。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_12"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你们都笑了。拉姆森把脸转向窗外，过了一会儿才伸手来盛第二碗。你认出这个动作和她第一次在甲板上递手套时很像，嘴上没答应，手已经腾出位置。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_13"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="如果有一天我想起来，发现自己以前不是个好人呢？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_14"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="桌上安静下来。你有一点后悔把话问出口。弗莱彻没有立刻说你一定是，她转了转空碗，认真想了一会儿。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_15"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="fletcher"

speaker_name=""

text="那就把具体的事拿出来说。该负责的负责，该查清的查清。我们今天认识的是做过这些事的你，不是一个凭名字就能判完的人。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_16"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="我可能会生气，也可能骂你。这个不能提前免掉。但至少你得先回来，听完再说。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_17"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="好。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_18"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="门外有人催最后一遍熄灯。你把自己的碗洗好，再把别人留在桌上的也一起搬去。灯灭的时候，锅已经擦干，门也锁好了。谁都没有为了留住这一晚，让第二天的人没法开始。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

